@Sigloc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5067

### Register a shipper (Contratante) — open self-service
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register/contratante
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "razaoSocial": "Logística Nacional S.A.",
  "nomeFantasia": "LogNac",
  "email": "admin@lognac.com.br",
  "senha": "Password123!"
}

### Validate a smart invite (Convite Inteligente)
GET {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/invite/TOKEN123
Accept: application/json

### Smart onboarding of a carrier (Transportadora)
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/invite/TOKEN123/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "98.765.432/0001-10",
  "razaoSocial": "Transporte Rápido LTDA",
  "nomeFantasia": "TransRap",
  "email": "ops@transrap.com.br",
  "senha": "Password123!"
}

### Login (common to all profiles)
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@lognac.com.br",
  "senha": "Password123!"
}

### Register a shipper (Contratante) using a Google account
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register/contratante/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "<google-id-token>",
  "cnpj": "12.345.678/0001-90",
  "razaoSocial": "Logística Nacional S.A.",
  "nomeFantasia": "LogNac"
}

### Smart onboarding of a carrier (Transportadora) via invite using a Google account
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/invite/TOKEN123/register/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "<google-id-token>",
  "cnpj": "98.765.432/0001-10",
  "razaoSocial": "Transporte Rápido LTDA",
  "nomeFantasia": "TransRap"
}

### Login using a Google account (common to all profiles)
POST {{Sigloc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "<google-id-token>"
}

###
